==================================================================================================
  [ok ]  1. MATTER feels Phi~ = Phi + a  (conformal fifth force reaches dynamics)
         Phi~_matter = Phi + a
  [ok ]  2. LIGHT is CONFORMALLY BLIND: the conformal factor cancels in n^2 = g~_ij/(-g~_00)
         n^2 = (-2*Psi*eps + 1)/(2*Phi*eps + 1)  (no 'a')
  [ok ]  3. LIGHT sees Phi~+Psi~ = Phi+Psi (Einstein frame ~ baryonic) => NO MOND boost => UNDER-LENSES
